			"Message": "refactor(Project): Enforce PascalCase naming and add telemetry across all submodules\n\nCoordinated update across 11 Land editor submodules implementing the PascalCase naming convention and adding telemetry infrastructure:\n\n- Common: Rename trait methods and effect constructors to PascalCase (ReadFile, WriteFile, GetConfiguration_effect, etc.)\n- Grove: Update protobuf message field names to PascalCase (breaking protocol change)\n- Mountain: Rename binary to 'Mountain', add PostHog telemetry, OTLP proxy, Vine protocol PascalCase\n- Wind: Add terminal/update service stubs, fix IPC command naming to PascalCase\n- Output: Add PostHog build telemetry, complete Electron-to-Tauri polyfill layer\n- Sky: Add OTELBridge and PostHogBridge for telemetry, enhance workbench loading with performance.mark()\n- Air, Mist, Rest, SideCar: Apply consistent Rust formatting and style\n\nThis completes the naming standardization effort and enables crash telemetry and performance analytics for the Land editor.",
			"SHA": "dab18b06ccd74245e396c5c963334ed8d5acb18d"
		}
